            </div>
            <div class="action-card">
                <div class="icon">🤝</div>
                <p>Partnerships</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faculties">
        <div class="faculties-header">
            <div>
                <span class="our-researchers">Our researchers</span>
                <h2>Featured Faculties</h2>
            </div>
            <a href="#" class="view-all">View all staff profiles →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="faculty-grid">

            <div class="faculty-card">
                <div class="faculty-top">
                    <img src="prof1.jpg" alt="Prof. Adewale Okonkwo">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Prof. Adewale Okonkwo</h3>
                        <p>Professor of Computer Science</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>Artificial intelligence, machine learning and data-driven solutions for public health challenges in sub-Saharan Africa.</p>
                <div class="tags">
                    <span class="tag">Biology</span>
                    <span class="tag">Sciences</span>
                    <span class="tag">Physics</span>
                </div>
                <div class="faculty-links">
                    <a href="#">Google scholar </a>
                    <a href="#">View Profile </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faculty-card">
                <div class="faculty-top">
                    <img src="prof2.jpg" alt="Dr. Blessing Nwosu">
                    <div>
